          "line_end": 40,
          "line_start": 40,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kuafuai/aipexbase",
          "url": "https://github.com/kuafuai/aipexbase/blob/bf523cfa479f25dfe78516b78658fc98ed15c611/README.md#L40-L40"
        },
        {
          "commit": "bf523cfa479f25dfe78516b78658fc98ed15c611",
          "git_sha": "93bf5c754e24b3e54e962845d4994edb7bbde8b9",
          "line_end": 38,
          "line_start": 38,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kuafuai/aipexbase",
          "url": "https://github.com/kuafuai/aipexbase/blob/bf523cfa479f25dfe78516b78658fc98ed15c611/README.md#L38-L38"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4e96695106e125aec39bf4696f4fc9cb1d40ec4492fecb61c9995458631c9328",
        "slc_e8969e5c1ef2a2db3629fd48abdb8121ee8139f721df0555dc39634d163c2a4a"
      ],
      "text": "The core philosophy is providing a complete backend without writing backend code, so developers can skip backend implementation and integrate via SDK from any AI coding tool."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_08d4e8e5e3002d8f835360b60f07d9d0573bf0bb3f8acf10aed4c9d247d57ed0",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "bf523cfa479f25dfe78516b78658fc98ed15c611",
          "git_sha": "93bf5c754e24b3e54e962845d4994edb7bbde8b9",
          "line_end": 22,
          "line_start": 3,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kuafuai/aipexbase",
          "url": "https://github.com/kuafuai/aipexbase/blob/bf523cfa479f25dfe78516b78658fc98ed15c611/README.md#L3-L22"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1429a8d614a2782db7cc60095d0448ed8ebe3e353a06c6ebd387eeb41e0d0ea2"
      ],
      "text": "The stack includes a Spring Boot 2 backend and a Vue 3 management console, per README badges."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a4d23f2e873a0fec29372099564bfc76fc0d88a4e7f7a0ec9d3e70472540b865",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "bf523cfa479f25dfe78516b78658fc98ed15c611",
          "git_sha": "93bf5c754e24b3e54e962845d4994edb7bbde8b9",
          "line_end": 56,
          "line_start": 54,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kuafuai/aipexbase",
          "url": "https://github.com/kuafuai/aipexbase/blob/bf523cfa479f25dfe78516b78658fc98ed15c611/README.md#L54-L56"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_913bfb257177e93a93e49a2eaf2c4d1dbb016c5c7fb71861ed68e602c9271d60"
      ],
      "text": "The product offers native MCP compatibility so models and agents can directly invoke backend capabilities, plus a unified context and data layer for long-term memory and traceable state."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1664e5a66b28200ace3bae43f5da7db612e4c82c1ed1bdb3bc040c9b898f6126",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "bf523cfa479f25dfe78516b78658fc98ed15c611",
          "git_sha": "93bf5c754e24b3e54e962845d4994edb7bbde8b9",
          "line_end": 62,
          "line_start": 59,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kuafuai/aipexbase",
          "url": "https://github.com/kuafuai/aipexbase/blob/bf523cfa479f25dfe78516b78658fc98ed15c611/README.md#L59-L62"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b888a043843e2dca6d38ea72bf0736f0d5f1c9c66f3dca041e12f440bc57ad3f"
      ],
      "text": "Out-of-the-box capabilities include automated data storage, user authentication with permission control, third-party AI service integration, and session/state context management."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a475a0c49a83fcfea4a9b67170eb723f3ed9f402d96ea6717beb58b5f7591019",
