        "slc_e355579e23840773979d5c10a8582251bf372a62316b7df79bfba838a0d9c05c"
      ],
      "text": "AI IDEs connect via an MCP server endpoint of the form /mcp/sse?token=<apikey>, configured in Cursor's mcpServers settings."
    },
