        "slc_f6ac23cb58349335e7f378609376f20e8f48007e31fdaada7aa406fa39aff844"
      ],
      "text": "External reverse-proxy setups are supported with nginx snippets routing /baas-api and /mcp to port 8080, with long-connection timeouts (86400s) and buffering disabled for the MCP route."
